{
  "about": "Shot list for npm run video. Scenes are filmed in order per cut; `seconds` is the clip length before transitions overlap it. `card` scenes are tools/video/card.html (`lockup` inlines a brand kit lockup, `images` inlines brand kit PNGs); `app` scenes are the real renderer on data/snapshot.json with `demo.match` in place of the snapshot's example match, and Ghost Mode on the frozen screens in tools/video/ghost.json. `setup` runs before the camera rolls, `steps` at `at` seconds after. `continue` keeps the previous scene's page, so a cut between them is invisible. `zoom` on a scene overrides the cut's. Scenes with enabled:false are skipped unless named in --with.",
